From 54d20cf6f0a0b01968cdcd19cc290e5eec674462 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xander Burchartz <210020462+xanderburchartz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:50:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] grib_pi: iOS layout

GRIB control bar, settings and request dialogs fitted to a phone screen
(compact bar as on Android, plus the file open button that Android
replaces with its own screen). The last GRIB file is remembered across
reinstalls and app kills, and GRIB files get their own Documents/GRIB folder.

All changes are inside #ifdef __OCPN__IOS__; other platforms are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 plugins/grib_pi/src/CursorData.cpp         |  39 +++
 plugins/grib_pi/src/GribRequestDialog.cpp  |  12 +
 plugins/grib_pi/src/GribSettingsDialog.cpp |  64 +++++
 plugins/grib_pi/src/GribUIDialog.cpp       |  77 +++++-
 plugins/grib_pi/src/GribUIDialogBase.cpp   | 278 ++++++++++++++++++++-
 5 files changed, 468 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

